    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77792" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραβλαστ-άνω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ήσω</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sprout</i> or <i>shoot up beside</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i><i>Acut. (Sp.)</i><i><span class="en">
				26
			</span></i> (cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				15.837
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				762a4
			</span></i>: metaph., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				573d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>shoot sideways</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				5.1.3
			</span></i>; of bulbous plants, <i>make offsets</i>, ib. <i><span class="en">
				7.2.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c. acc.,
				<i>put forth like shoots</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς κακίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Them.
					<u>Or.</u>
					32.360b
				</span></i>
			.</div>
